	(text "TEST POINTS (bring-up timing: measure /AS->/SLAVEn at the edge connector and per stage; /BERR monitors bus collisions)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01b2e0fa-7d82-5e3e-8f21-628b1002111e")
	)
	(text "B port = Zorro D0-D15 (VCCB = +5V_BUS): drives full 5 V levels.\nA port = local bus LD0-LD15 (VCCA = +3V3).\nDIR=H: A->B (card drives Zorro, reads). DIR=L: B->A.\n~{OE}=H: both ports Hi-Z (isolation). ~{OE} = U107: ZF_DBUF_OE_N OR CARD_EN_N.\nBus-hold on all data inputs: no pull resistors (TI SCES635B).\nVCC isolation: either supply at 0 V -> all outputs Hi-Z.\nRN101-RN104: 22R series damping, value TBV by SI measurement."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "346c3e62-eace-5461-8bfb-73bb1e81960c")
	)
	(text "DESIGN NOTES (summary; full analysis in docs/stage2/sheet1-design-notes.md)\n1. /SLAVEn must assert <= 35 ns after /AS and negate <= 50 ns after /AS rises (Zorro III spec App. K, Zorro II\n   compatibility). Path: U102 (tpd <= 4.1 ns) + FPGA combinational (datasheet floor 7.24 ns, -4; final value from\n   Diamond STA, gate G-STA) + U104 (tpd <= 4.4 ns) + R117 + PCB. 18 ns FPGA allocation is NOT proven.\n2. XRDY provision is fitted. HDL default mode inserts wait states via XRDY until zero-wait timing is measured.\n3. Power-off isolation: U101/U102 Ioff, U103/U104 VCC isolation + Ioff, U105 Ioff. Unpowered or disabled, the\n   card is Hi-Z on /SLAVEn and /CFGOUTn: A2000 R6 RP800 (1k up) and RP607 (1k down) make the slot look empty.\n4. Interfaces to sheet 2 (FPGA) are hierarchical labels: ZB_* (buffered Zorro inputs, incl. /BERR), ZF_*\n   (FPGA-driven), EN_OK, LD0-LD15. Power nets +3V3 / +5V_BUS come from sheet 5 (not yet drawn).\n5. Not yet validated: no ERC-clean claim implies electrical or timing correctness."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 214.63 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3e15f1ca-91c8-5ebe-bb7f-18deef3bc02b")
	)
	(text "DECOUPLING: one 100 nF per supply pin, placed at the pin (PCB); 10 uF bulk per rail on this sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76ac3978-16f7-5cd4-8af0-070ef6a28093")
	)
	(text "SAFE START-UP DEFAULTS. MachXO2 I/O are tri-stated with a weak pull-DOWN (IPD 30-305 uA) before/during\nconfiguration (Lattice FPGA-DS-02056-4.7). 2.2k pull-ups hold every Zorro output INACTIVE: node >= 3.0 V - 2.2k x 305 uA = 2.33 V > VIH 2.0 V.\nDIR pull-down keeps U103 pointing Zorro->local (never drives the Zorro bus)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "782ecb39-33ad-5c44-bc61-253d8b3ba33f")
	)
	(text "~{OE} tied low: inputs always enabled.\nOutputs drive FPGA inputs only.\n5.5 V-tolerant inputs; Ioff = no backfeed\nwhen +3V3 is off (TI SCAS699C)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a6a4b6b-235c-52cc-820e-2d24ac84adbc")
	)
	(text "CARD ENABLE AND FAIL-SAFE GATING (rev B, concerns C-03/C-04; docs/stage2/sheet1-design-notes.md section 6)\nEN_OK = U108 (+3V3 >= 3.07 V) AND U109 (+5V_BUS >= 4.27 V) AND JP101 open; each TPS3808 releases 12-28 ms after\nits rail is good (CT open, TI SBVS050N). CARD_EN_N = NAND(EN_OK, ZF_ARM). The FPGA drives ZF_ARM high only after\nit has seen /BUSRST asserted with EN_OK true: the card joins the bus at a reset boundary, never in mid-scan.\nCARD_EN_N high: U104 Hi-Z (A2000 1k pull-up / pull-down: /SLAVEn negated, /CFGOUTn passes the chain), U103\nisolated, XRDY and /INTx released: the slot looks EMPTY. With the carrier unpowered VCC isolation does the same."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e0aa673-52ab-545f-a380-644aebdf55a4")
	)
	(text "+3V3 and +5V_BUS are sourced by sheet 5 (U504 TLV76733, U503 eFuse)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 365.76 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "81ecd521-de4c-5168-809d-de4fdc642ce7")
	)
	(text "Open-drain (wired-OR per Zorro spec): /INT2, /INT6, XRDY. Inputs come from U107,\ngated by CARD_EN_N (released whenever the card is disabled). FPGA drives LOW to\nassert. XRDY kept fitted (wait-state provision; zero-wait timing NOT assumed until\nmeasured). /OVR, /DTACK paths DNP (automatic DTACK); if ever fitted they must be\ngated too. Spare channel 6: input tied high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a1304f57-6d4f-5ff4-86ca-6cc6a5879366")
	)
	(text "JP101 fitted: EN_OK low, card held off the bus\n(recovery from a faulty bitstream)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 365.76 327.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a1e3efd2-60d8-5b8b-9f65-656bafcbaa02")
	)
	(text "Ground: all 18 Zorro GND pins (incl. pin 91)\nto the ground plane. Zorro +5V (5,6), +12V (10),\n-5V (8), -12V (20) deliberately NOT connected\n(brief: no operating power from Zorro pins)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 325.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c1c55e2a-11b3-5b10-9f0f-4857a7b40dd5")
	)
	(text "U104 (rev B) has ~{OE} = CARD_EN_N: Hi-Z until the card is armed (EN_OK and\nZF_ARM), so a blank, unconfigured or faulty FPGA cannot block the AutoConfig\nchain; unpowered, VCC isolation gives Hi-Z. ~{OE} is static during operation, so\nit is not in the /SLAVEn timing path. DIR=H (A->B). Unused A3-A8/B3-B8 tied to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 312.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d46a9240-b60f-50ec-a74e-c9453eb5f8ac")
	)
	(text "U109 VIT- = 0.405 V x (1 + 95.3k/10k) = 4.27 V on +5V_BUS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 342.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fd3be3d7-2b7e-52e6-b132-0565d2206b4b")
	)
